        "answer": "The average current price of securities by sector is as follows:\n\n| Sector | Average Price |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| Consumer Discretionary | 3,380.00 |\n| Technology | 719.25 |\n| Healthcare | 285.17 |\n| Automotive | 248.50 |\n| Financials | 201.21 |\n| Consumer Staples | 173.86 |\n| Energy | 128.58 |",
