        "status": "answer",
        "answer": "The following portfolio has holdings in more than 5 different sectors:\n\n| Portfolio Name | Sector Count | Total Holdings | Diversification Ratio |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Total Stock Market Index Fund | 6 | 12 | 0.5 |",
        "tools": [
          {
            "tool": "sql_query",
            "arguments": {
              "sql": "SELECT \n    p.portfolio_name, \n    COUNT(DISTINCT s.sector_id) AS sector_count, \n    COUNT(h.holding_id) AS total_holdings,\n    ROUND(CAST(COUNT(DISTINCT s.sector_id) AS REAL) / COUNT(h.holding_id), 3) AS diversification_ratio\nFROM portfolios p\nJOIN holdings h ON p.portfolio_id = h.portfolio_id\nJOIN securities s ON h.security_id = s.security_id\nGROUP BY p.portfolio_id\nHAVING sector_count > 5\nORDER BY diversification_ratio DESC;",
              "question": "Find portfolios that have holdings in more than 5 different sectors and show their diversification metrics (portfolio_name, sector_count, total_holdings, diversification_ratio).",
              "explanation": "Calculate the number of distinct sectors and total holdings for each portfolio, then filter for those with more than 5 sectors. Calculate the diversification ratio as sector_count / total_holdings."
            },
            "result": {
              "columns": [
                "portfolio_name",
                "sector_count",
                "total_holdings",
                "diversification_ratio"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Total Stock Market Index Fund",
                  6,
                  12,
                  0.5
                ]
              ],
              "sql": "SELECT \n    p.portfolio_name, \n    COUNT(DISTINCT s.sector_id) AS sector_count, \n    COUNT(h.holding_id) AS total_holdings,\n    ROUND(CAST(COUNT(DISTINCT s.sector_id) AS REAL) / COUNT(h.holding_id), 3) AS diversification_ratio\nFROM portfolios p\nJOIN holdings h ON p.portfolio_id = h.portfolio_id\nJOIN securities s ON h.security_id = s.security_id\nGROUP BY p.portfolio_id\nHAVING sector_count > 5\nORDER BY diversification_ratio DESC;",
